&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Copy all contents of &lt;code&gt;Aurora/dotfiles/.config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;copy-all-contents-of-auroradotfilesconfig&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
