&lt;h3&gt;Step 3. Compile and install scripts of Aurora&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;step-3-compile-and-install-scripts-of-aurora&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#step-3-compile-and-install-scripts-of-aurora&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Go to &lt;code&gt;.config/hypr/scripts&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;go-to-confighyprscripts&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
